<title>MALAYSIA: Golden Hope 6-mth net little changed.</title>
<headline>Golden Hope 6-mth net little changed.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	10.8    vs	10.7</p>
<p>    Net profit		 108.54   vs     107.63</p>
<p>    Turnover		   703.63   vs     560.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   161.60   vs     158.57</p>
<p>    Minorities	less     5.04   vs less  4.31</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	 5.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Golden Hope Plantations Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
